1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,410
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:57,430
Where's Asuka?

37
00:01:57,430 --> 00:02:01,930
She's already left. It would seem that
she's determined not to see me.

38
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,020
Why?

39
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:07,060
Shinji, I guess you're still too young
to understand a woman's feelings.

40
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:11,730
Well...
By the way...

41
00:02:11,730 --> 00:02:13,360
Go ahead.

42
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:16,900
Is the rumor that Unit 04 went missing true?

43
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:19,700
I heard that there was some kind
of accident, and it exploded.

44
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,910
Yes, it's true.

45
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:25,660
Unit 04 vanished, along with
the Second Branch of Nerv.

46
00:02:25,660 --> 00:02:28,410
It happened while they were
testing the S2 engine.

47
00:02:28,410 --> 00:02:30,080
But don't worry, we'll be all right here.

48
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,250
All three of our Evas are functioning properly.

49
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:34,670
And we have a crack team of pilots and staff.

50
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:37,630
But I heard that Unit 03 is being
brought here from America.

51
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,930
You're performing the activation tests
at Matsushiro, aren't you?

52
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,800
I'll be out for four days or so,

53
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,640
but Kaji will be taking care of you two,
so don't worry.

54
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,890
But what about the test?

55
00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:48,520
Ritsuko will be there as well, after all.

56
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,060
There won't be any problems.

57
00:02:50,060 --> 00:02:51,190
But what about the pilot?

58
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:55,320
Well, about the pilot...

59
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,740
Yes?

60
00:03:03,740 --> 00:03:05,080
Good morning!

61
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:08,830
I've come today with a request, Major Katsuragi!

62
00:03:09,330 --> 00:03:13,790
Please! Make me the pilot
for Evangelion Unit 03!

63
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:18,300
EPISODE 18
SELECTION
OF LIFE

64
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:24,390
So, Shinji doesn't know yet?

65
00:03:24,390 --> 00:03:27,270
Finding the right time to tell him...

66
00:03:27,270 --> 00:03:28,600
I'm scared.

67
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:31,810
Sometimes I just can't tell
what the heck he's thinking.

68
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:33,480
Pull yourself together.

69
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,940
You're the one who volunteered
to be his guardian.

70
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:38,530
I know, but...

71
00:03:38,530 --> 00:03:40,860
So when are you calling in the pilot?

72
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:44,740
I think that'll be tomorrow.
There are a lot of things to prep, after all.

73
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:48,290
He might tell Shinji himself.

74
00:03:48,290 --> 00:03:49,950
I don't think so.

75
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:52,960
He wasn't enthused enough
to be bragging about it.

76
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:56,790
Getting his sister transferred to
our hospital here at Headquarters

77
00:03:56,790 --> 00:03:59,010
was the one condition he gave.

78
00:04:00,050 --> 00:04:02,840
Man, Miss Misato sure can be cold.

79
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:05,050
I'm number one when it comes to enthusiasm,

80
00:04:05,050 --> 00:04:07,640
so she could at least use me,
even if it's just as a backup.

81
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,140
Right, Toji?

82
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:19,150
What happened? You left before me,
but you're awfully late.

83
00:04:19,150 --> 00:04:22,150
What, no marital spat today?

84
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:26,820
I just didn't want to see your ugly faces!

85
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:28,160
You three damn stooges!

86
00:04:34,790 --> 00:04:37,250
Now, time to eat!

87
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:39,170
Hey, where's Toji?

88
00:04:39,170 --> 00:04:40,550
He's gone.

89
00:04:40,550 --> 00:04:43,380
Without even eating lunch? Him?

90
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:45,300
That's impossible.

91
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:48,600
He's been acting odd lately, hasn't he?

92
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:55,270
Suzuhara...

93
00:04:55,900 --> 00:05:00,070
Oh, Ayanami, if you're lookin' for Shinji,
he ain't here.

94
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:04,490
You know 'bout me, don't you?

95
00:05:04,490 --> 00:05:06,110
Seems Sohryu knows too.

96
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:10,870
So Shinji's the only one who doesn't know.

97
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:14,210
You don't usually care 'bout people.

98
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:17,580
Really? I'm not sure I understand.

99
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:19,920
The one you care about's Shinji.

100
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,500
Do I?

101
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,880
You may be right.

102
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,220
Yeah, you do.

103
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,220
Hikari!

104
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:31,760
Let's have lunch!

105
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:36,560
Two hours late, and then, finally, he arrives.

106
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:39,900
He's the first guy to ever make me
wait this long.

107
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:42,900
Yeah, because you never waited for the guy
when you were dating, right?

108
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:48,780
And so this was the so-called Second Impact.

109
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:52,160
At that time I was living in a place
called Nebukawa,

110
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:56,080
but the rising water levels caused
by the melting of Antarctica

111
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:59,000
have submerged it beneath the sea.

112
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:04,130
Sorry, transfer student,
but I've gotta beat you up!

113
00:06:04,670 --> 00:06:07,470
I won't feel right until I've smacked you.

114
00:06:16,730 --> 00:06:20,650
I'm sorry, Asuka. You always
walk home with Ikari.

115
00:06:20,650 --> 00:06:23,690
Forget it. The only reason I'm with Shinji
is because of work.

116
00:06:23,690 --> 00:06:26,400
And I don't feel like seeing him today anyway.

117
00:06:30,030 --> 00:06:32,070
This is about Suzuhara, isn't it?

118
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:33,780
Yes. You could tell?

119
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:35,120
It's obvious.

120
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:38,120
The three stooges are about
the only ones who don't see it.

121
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:40,460
But Ikari seems naïve.

122
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:42,460
Actually, he's the most dense of them all.

123
00:06:42,460 --> 00:06:44,050
And he's an idiot to boot.

124
00:06:44,050 --> 00:06:46,170
He doesn't know how to relate to people.

125
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:47,800
Really?

126
00:06:52,550 --> 00:06:56,390
I think Suzuhara might like Miss Ayanami.

127
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:59,890
Suzuhara does?! Miss Perfect?!

128
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:02,520
They seemed to be getting along during lunch.

129
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,400
Don't worry, Hikari. There's no way.

130
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:09,240
She's a million times denser than Shinji is
about relating to people!

131
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,400
Really?

132
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,450
Really!

133
00:07:14,330 --> 00:07:16,080
Can I ask you one thing?

134
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,160
What?

135
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,580
What do you see in that hot-headed stooge?

136
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,630
His kindness...

137
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,850
Come to think of it...

138
00:07:37,850 --> 00:07:39,930
Kaji sure spends a lot of time in the tub.

139
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:45,110
I wonder who's going to pilot Unit 03?

140
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,860
You mean you haven't heard yet?

141
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:48,440
Who is it?

142
00:07:52,910 --> 00:07:54,320
I don't know.

143
00:07:55,410 --> 00:07:57,030
That was refreshing!

144
00:07:57,450 --> 00:08:00,040
What? Are you two fighting again?

145
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,210
You guys are hopeless.

146
00:08:01,210 --> 00:08:03,250
Are you two always like this
when Katsuragi's gone?

147
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:04,420
No!

148
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:08,840
I get to spend the night with you, after all,
so I'd love to be all happy and smiling.

149
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:12,510
But I can't do it tonight. I just can't.

150
00:08:15,300 --> 00:08:18,100
I understand. Let's go to bed.

151
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:20,890
Going to bed early is the best thing
for these situations.

152
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:30,400
Are you asleep yet, Kaji?

153
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:32,490
No, not yet.

154
00:08:32,950 --> 00:08:35,740
What's my father like?

155
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:37,780
Well, that came out of nowhere.

156
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:40,290
I thought you'd ask about Katsuragi.

157
00:08:40,290 --> 00:08:42,830
Because it seems like you're
always with my father.

158
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:45,750
It's the Vice Commander who's always with him.

159
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:48,500
Have you been asking around
about your father?

160
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:52,420
Because I haven't been around him much.

161
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:54,010
So you don't really know him?

162
00:08:54,470 --> 00:08:58,350
But I've learned a lot about him lately.

163
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:02,980
About his work, about my mother, so...

164
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:06,270
You're wrong there. You only
believe that you've learned.

165
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:09,980
People can't understand others completely.

166
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:12,360
Who knows if you can even
understand yourself?

167
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,990
Understanding each other one hundred percent
is impossible.

168
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:20,200
Of course, that's why we spend so much time
trying to understand ourselves and others.

169
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:23,080
That's what makes life so interesting.

170
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,040
Is that also true for you and Miss Misato?

171
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:29,710
The word we use for "she" literally
means "the woman far away".

172
00:09:29,710 --> 00:09:33,670
To us, women will always be
on the distant shore.

173
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:38,470
Basically, there's a river dividing men and
women, deeper and wider than the ocean.

174
00:09:38,470 --> 00:09:40,850
I don't understand adults.

175
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:45,730
T minus 300 minutes to Unit 03 activation test.

176
00:09:46,190 --> 00:09:48,060
TEST SITE 2, MATSUHIRO

177
00:09:46,810 --> 00:09:48,650
Main power supply, no problems.

178
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,400
TEMPORARY UNDERGROUND CAGE (UNMANNED)

179
00:09:48,650 --> 00:09:50,650
Second apoptosis is nominal.

180
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,610
SAME SURFACE FACILITY

181
00:09:50,650 --> 00:09:52,980
Coolant systems are normal in all sectors.

182
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:55,070
Repairs to left arm crimp lock completed.

183
00:09:53,860 --> 00:09:56,610
EVA UNIT-03 ACTIVATION EXPERIMENT
INTEGRATED CONTROL POSITION

184
00:09:55,070 --> 00:09:57,610
Roger. Team B, commence operation.

185
00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:58,990
ON BOARD CENTRAL GENERAL
COMMAND VEHICLE

186
00:09:57,610 --> 00:10:00,240
No problems detected in
the data link to Unit 01.

187
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:02,700
It could even go into combat as is.

188
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:04,700
Really? That's nice.

189
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,620
Now that was a half-hearted reply.

190
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:10,880
You know, once this unit is cleared for duty,
it'll be assigned directly under your command.

191
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:13,090
The exclusive control of four Evas...

192
00:10:13,710 --> 00:10:16,420
If you wanted to, you could destroy the world.

193
00:10:17,590 --> 00:10:19,890
Have you told Shinji yet?

194
00:10:19,890 --> 00:10:21,890
I will when the test is over.

195
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:24,600
The Fourth Child has arrived.

196
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:27,980
Second squad, begin readying
the entry vehicle immediately.

197
00:10:29,850 --> 00:10:32,190
He's not here yet, is he, Asuka?

198
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:35,190
He may not be coming today.

199
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:38,780
I thought we might finally eat together today...

200
00:10:39,780 --> 00:10:40,570
Do you want this?

201
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:46,040
Unit 03's already in Japan, isn't it?

202
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:49,290
Yeah, I think it got here yesterday.

203
00:10:49,290 --> 00:10:52,590
Must be nice. I wonder who's going to pilot it?

204
00:10:53,290 --> 00:10:57,050
Maybe it's Toji? He's absent today, after all.

205
00:10:57,050 --> 00:10:58,470
No way!

206
00:11:00,050 --> 00:11:02,470
Entry plug fixed in place.

207
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:04,350
Initiating first connection.

208
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:05,640
Transmitting pulse.

209
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:07,020
Graph readout is normal.

210
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:09,230
Checklist cleared up to 1350.

211
00:11:09,230 --> 00:11:11,020
No problems found in initial contact phase.

212
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:13,900
Roger. Shift the operation to phase two.

213
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:15,730
All nerve links are normal.

214
00:11:15,730 --> 00:11:17,690
Checklist cleared up to 2550.

215
00:11:17,690 --> 00:11:20,150
All harmonics are normal.

216
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:22,410
We are now exceeding the absolute border.

217
00:11:24,950 --> 00:11:26,910
Abort the test! Break the circuit!

218
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:31,670
No good! High energy readings
detected in body!

219
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:32,670
Impossible!

220
00:11:34,290 --> 00:11:35,090
An Angel?!

221
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:57,440
An explosion has occurred in Matsushiro.

222
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,730
Damage level unknown.

223
00:11:58,730 --> 00:12:01,610
Send the rescue squad and the Third Troop.

224
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:04,110
Take care of it before the SSDF gets involved.

225
00:12:04,110 --> 00:12:04,950
Roger.

226
00:12:04,950 --> 00:12:07,410
Movement of an unidentified object
detected at the site.

227
00:12:07,410 --> 00:12:10,370
Pattern is orange. We can't
confirm it to be an Angel.

228
00:12:10,370 --> 00:12:12,920
Go to battle stations, Level One.

229
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:15,040
All personnel, battle stations, Level One.

230
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:16,840
Prepare for ground combat.

231
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,590
Launch all Eva units!

232
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:20,630
Dispatch immediately to intercept locations.

233
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:22,880
Air transport is scheduled to go in twenty.

234
00:12:29,310 --> 00:12:31,180
An accident in Matsushiro?!

235
00:12:31,180 --> 00:12:34,100
No way! Then, are Miss Misato
and the others okay?!

236
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,850
We can't contact them yet.

237
00:12:35,850 --> 00:12:38,150
No way. What will we do?

238
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:40,320
What are you blubbering about?!

239
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:43,650
Worrying about them right now
won't get us anywhere!

240
00:12:43,650 --> 00:12:45,990
But how can we fight the Angel by ourselves?

241
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:50,040
Commander Ikari is taking direct command now.

242
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,620
My father is?

243
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:54,920
We have a visual of the target at Mt. Nobe.
Transferring to main monitor.

244
00:13:01,590 --> 00:13:03,470
As I thought...

245
00:13:03,470 --> 00:13:05,680
Transmit the abort signal.

246
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:07,510
Force eject the entry plug.

247
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:13,770
Not working. Neither abort signal
nor plug ejection code accepted.

248
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:14,940
What about the pilot?

249
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:18,190
We still have respiratory and cardiac
response, but he's probably...

250
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:22,400
Evangelion Unit 03 will be
abandoned at this time.

251
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:25,610
It will be designated as the Thirteenth Angel.

252
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:26,860
But, Sir!

253
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:29,530
Deploy the battle line at Mt. Nobe as planned.

254
00:13:29,530 --> 00:13:30,910
Destroy the target.

255
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,500
Target is approaching.

256
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:37,580
All units prepare for ground combat.

257
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:39,960
No way!

258
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:42,340
An Angel? Is that an Angel?!

259
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:44,340
Correct, that is the target.

260
00:13:44,970 --> 00:13:47,550
You said that this is the target,

261
00:13:47,550 --> 00:13:49,140
but it's an Eva, isn't it?!

262
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,350
But that's...

263
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:54,560
How could it have been taken over by an Angel?

264
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:59,100
I wonder if it's piloted by a human too?
A child our age?

265
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:01,980
You still don't know?! The pilot of Unit 03 is...

266
00:14:03,110 --> 00:14:04,030
Asuka?

267
00:14:09,490 --> 00:14:10,660
Asuka?!

268
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:17,580
Eva Unit 02 has gone silent!

269
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:19,880
The pilot has ejected. Recovery squad
is heading for retrieval.

270
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:21,750
Target is moving towards Unit 00!

271
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:25,920
Rei, avoid close range combat
and stop the target.

272
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,340
I'm sending Unit 01 over now.

273
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:28,090
Roger.

274
00:14:44,610 --> 00:14:46,780
He's in there.

275
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:05,960
The Angel is invading Unit 00's left arm.

276
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,710
The nerve systems are being corrupted.

277
00:15:08,050 --> 00:15:10,180
Sever the left arm. Quickly!

278
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:12,680
But if we don't cut the neural connections first...

279
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:14,470
Sever it.

280
00:15:14,470 --> 00:15:14,970
Yes, Sir.

281
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:34,490
Unit 00 is severely damaged.
The pilot is wounded.

282
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:35,530
No way...

283
00:15:35,530 --> 00:15:36,870
The target is approaching you.

284
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:40,210
It will contact you in twenty.
You must destroy it.

285
00:15:40,210 --> 00:15:42,330
But this target is...

286
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,420
Isn't there a person in there?

287
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:55,800
Another child my own age.

288
00:16:17,700 --> 00:16:19,370
An entry plug!

289
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:21,330
There is a person in there, just as I thought.

290
00:16:37,470 --> 00:16:39,560
Problems in life support!

291
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,390
The pilot's in danger!

292
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:44,390
Not good! Cut the synch rate to 60%!

293
00:16:44,390 --> 00:16:45,270
Wait!

294
00:16:45,270 --> 00:16:48,230
But Ikari, at this rate, the pilot will die.

295
00:16:48,230 --> 00:16:50,650
Shinji, why don't you fight?

296
00:16:50,650 --> 00:16:53,950
But there's a person in there, Father!

297
00:16:53,950 --> 00:16:56,950
Irrelevant! It is an Angel! Our enemy!

298
00:16:56,950 --> 00:16:59,620
But... but I can't!

299
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:02,660
I've got to save them! I can't just kill somebody!

300
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:04,160
You'll die.

301
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,750
I don't care! It's better than killing someone!

302
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:12,010
Never mind! Cut all synchronization
between the pilot and Unit 01.

303
00:17:12,010 --> 00:17:13,130
Cut it?

304
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:16,470
Correct. Switch the control circuit
to the dummy plug.

305
00:17:16,470 --> 00:17:19,560
But the dummy system still has
a lot of problems,

306
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:21,640
and without Dr. Akagi's approval...

307
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:25,100
It'll be of more use than the pilot. Do it!

308
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:26,310
Yes, Sir.

309
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:38,820
What is this?

310
00:17:40,410 --> 00:17:42,370
What did you do, Father?!

311
00:17:42,370 --> 00:17:44,450
Reception of the signal, confirmed.

312
00:17:44,450 --> 00:17:46,750
Control system switch is complete.

313
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:49,590
All nerves linked directly to the dummy system.

314
00:17:49,590 --> 00:17:53,920
32.8% of Emotional Elements are unclear.
They can't be monitored.

315
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:57,180
Irrelevant. Release the system.
Commence attack.

316
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:21,410
This is the power of the dummy plug?

317
00:18:21,410 --> 00:18:22,950
System status nominal.

318
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:24,540
Gain still increasing.

319
00:19:16,250 --> 00:19:17,960
Stop it!

320
00:19:19,470 --> 00:19:22,640
Father, stop! Stop doing this!

321
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:25,720
Damn! Stop!

322
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:30,100
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

323
00:19:39,190 --> 00:19:40,150
Stop!

324
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:45,780
STOP!

325
00:19:52,830 --> 00:19:56,130
Eva Unit 03, no, I mean,

326
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:59,340
the target is completely silent.

327
00:20:06,930 --> 00:20:08,680
I'll make this.

328
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:13,190
Kodama, Nozomi, and I...
This recipe is for four.

329
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:16,440
I wonder if he'll eat it tomorrow?

330
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:19,940
We've found a survivor over here too!
He's still breathing!

331
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:21,860
Third squad, erase 807 data
as soon as possible.

332
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:21,860
Send help right away!

333
00:20:25,620 --> 00:20:28,540
Second squad, please hurry and check
for survivors in the linear block.

334
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:28,740
Am I still alive?

335
00:20:30,580 --> 00:20:31,960
Kaji?

336
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:34,170
You were lucky, Katsuragi.

337
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:38,040
Where's Ritsuko?

338
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,670
Don't worry.

339
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:41,170
She wasn't hurt as bad as you.

340
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,050
I see.

341
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:45,430
What about Eva Unit 03?

342
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:49,010
It was apparently destroyed,
as an Angel, by Unit 01.

343
00:20:54,390 --> 00:20:58,860
I... I haven't told Shinji anything.

344
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:08,660
Shinji...

345
00:21:08,660 --> 00:21:11,540
Miss Misato, so you're all right?

346
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:13,330
I...

347
00:21:13,330 --> 00:21:14,960
I'm sorry.

348
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:20,300
I had something important to tell you, but...

349
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:22,920
Miss Misato, I...

350
00:21:23,420 --> 00:21:25,300
I killed...

351
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:27,510
It was my father...

352
00:21:27,510 --> 00:21:29,810
I begged him to stop, but...

353
00:21:30,470 --> 00:21:34,350
Shinji, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

354
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:36,480
Report from the entry plug recovery team.

355
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:38,610
The pilot's life signs are confirmed.

356
00:21:38,610 --> 00:21:40,070
He's alive?!

357
00:21:40,070 --> 00:21:43,400
Unit 03's pilot is...

358
00:21:44,570 --> 00:21:46,700
The Fourth Child is...

359
00:21:47,410 --> 00:21:48,950
Toji?

360
00:21:49,450 --> 00:21:51,160
Shinji?

361
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:53,410
Shinji?

362
00:21:53,410 --> 00:21:55,290
Shinji?!

363
00:21:55,290 --> 00:21:56,830
Shinji?!

364
00:21:56,830 --> 00:21:57,790
Shinji?!

365
00:21:57,830 --> 00:22:00,460
TO BE CONTINUED

366
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:06,690
PREVIEW

367
00:23:06,820 --> 00:23:10,530
Shinji finally, of his own will,
quits as an Eva pilot.

368
00:23:10,530 --> 00:23:16,370
But regardless of his decision, the strongest of
the Angels attacks, giving rise to a new tragedy.

369
00:23:16,410 --> 00:23:18,710
Next time: "A Man's Battle"

370
00:23:19,410 --> 00:23:20,870
A MAN'S BATTLE
